                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-20-reg&quot;>Lori joined AbbVie in 2019 as Regulatory Affairs Director after spending numerous years working in the Swiss Regulatory Affairs environment, working closely with &lt;i>Swissmedic&lt;/i>. Before joining AbbVie, she led the regulatory affairs department as well as the business development department at a Swiss pharma company.&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;span class=&quot;body-unica-20-reg&quot;>Lori holds a Master’s degree of science in molecular and cell biology from the University of Basel, and a PhD in the field of oncology from the University of Cambridge, UK. She also worked as a postdoc at the ETH before transitioning into regulatory affairs.&lt;/span>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
